        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0117">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">polypropylene having weight-average molecular weight of 5.7 ⁇ 10 5 and having a melting temperature of 163° C. and BaTiO 3 having average particle size of 0.04  ⁇ m</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">were used, wherein the contents of the two components were 30 wt % and 70 wt %, respectively.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0117">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the thickness of the prepared sheet of the inner layer</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was 50  ⁇ m.</span>
