        <span itemprop="subject">a layer</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">polyethylene having weight-average molecular weight of 3.0 ⁇ 10 5 and having a melting temperature of 134° C. and paraffin oil having kinetic viscosity of 95 cSt at 40° C. were used, wherein the contents of the two components were 30 wt % and 70 wt %, respectively.</span>
